2%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%E5%88%86%E7%BB%93%E6%99%B6%22%2C%22count%22%3A3%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1132%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22count%22%3A3%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%9B%B8%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E9%95%9C%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A12%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1273%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1716999623632\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/04/01/282941837/b6fbbe0be54657ef68a0973c49db1b80_1896706641478635243.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">294</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">16</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">普罗米修斯最为惯用的武器，也是在她手中诞生的第一件机械造物。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\">尽管普罗米修斯一口咬定，研发这组拳套只是为了更好地展示自己的攻击性能，但至少，自那之后她有了可以玩猜拳的对象。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\">「不过，为什么要取名叫『潘多拉之盒』？它和灾难有什么关系吗？」</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\">「启动它试试，你就知道了。」</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">多悭的希望</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:18秒]拳套获得持续15秒的【企望】状态，【企望】状态期间自身全伤害提高20.0％，抗打断力提高。必杀技伤害命中敌人时，自身物理伤害提高15.0％，持续到【企望】状态结束，重复触发刷新充能时间；终末协理0017使用时，【再生-超对称粒子】攻击额外附加400.0％攻击力物理伤害，使用【存在-位形流形】和【再生-超对称粒子】时触发武器主动技能，并回复1000点【致密中子护盾】生命值</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">延宕的未来</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">全队物理伤害提高18.0％（该效果唯一生效）；终末协理0017使用时，【企望】状态期间，【再生-超对称粒子】命中敌人时，使全场所有敌人受到的物理伤害提高12.0％，持续20秒，重复触发刷新持续时间，该技能唯一生效</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取途径</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">补给获取</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">活动补给、精准补给</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">大伟哥别墅</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">消耗</span><a href=\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/bh3/wiki/content/1180/detail\" data-type=\"obc-content\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">大伟哥黑金卡</span></a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">兑换获得</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 3;\"> <div data-part=\"material\" data-tmpl=\"stigmata\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-stigmata obc-tmpl__part--material obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>进化材料</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgrou