-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/04/19/282941837/30a22e49bda76862676df6049e3cf723_3610033124499690557.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>终末协理0017</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">推荐武器，很好的契合了角色的技能机制，提供的自身增伤、全队物伤和易伤能显著地提高全队的物理输出。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/04/19/282941837/ad47584f41b28db5250b7c98bd40a272_8078443495052069397.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>甜辣女孩</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">与角色的物理辅助定位相性较好，武器提供提供无条件的全队物伤，能同时提高自身和物理输出队友的输出能力。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/04/19/282941837/e486117ad8c3d408a02ac9e8aa36b55d_2604410392526177982.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">拥有一定泛用性的物理属性拳套武器，与现有的拳套辅助相性都比较好。武器主动提供【企望】状态，提高自身全伤，并在必杀技后进一步给予物伤，配合被动提供的常驻全队物伤，能显著地提高全队的物理输出。普罗米修斯使用时，能强化追加攻击，还能额外提供物理易伤，用于输出和辅助时均有较好的表现。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/04/19/282941837/e486117ad8c3d408a02ac9e8aa36b55d_2604410392526177982.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
